    <tags>playsmith media video audio vlc player windows11 privacy</tags>
    <summary>Privacy-first media player for Windows 11 powered by VLC with auto-fix recovery and volume leveling.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[PlaySmith is a modern Windows 11 media player engineered on the battle-tested VLC engine. Plays almost every video and music format, discs, and network streams. Features intelligent AutoFix recovery, smart aspect ratio cropping, volume matching, and TV casting.]]></description>
